{"shortDescription":"OSLO, Norway, Oct. 19, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Multiconsult ASA (Oslo: MULTI) has held an extraordinary general meeting today, 19 October 2026. All items on the agenda were approved as proposed, including the merger with Rejlers AB (publ), with the following resolution:\"The merger plan dated 7 Septemb…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["OSLO, Norway, Oct. 19, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Multiconsult ASA (Oslo: MULTI) has held an extraordinary general meeting today, 19 October 2026. All items on the agenda were approved as proposed, including the merger with Rejlers AB (publ), with the following resolution:"]},{"type":"p","children":["\"The merger plan dated 7 September 2026 between the Company as the transferring company and Rejlers AB (publ) as the acquiring company is approved.\""]},{"type":"p","children":["The minutes of the extraordinary general meeting, including the record of attending shareholders and the voting protocol, are attached hereto and are also available on the company's website."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Investor relations:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Pål-Sverre Jørgensen, Group Treasurer \u0026 IRO"]},{"type":"p","children":["Phone: +47 416 11 161"]},{"type":"p","children":["E-mail: ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:ir@multiconsult.no","linkText":"ir@multiconsult.no"}}," / ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:psmj@multiconsult.no","linkText":"psmj@multiconsult.no"}}]},{"type":"p","children":["Media:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Lars Nermoen, Communications Director"]},{"type":"p","children":["Phone: +47 902 40 153"]},{"type":"p","children":["E-mail: ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:lars.nermoen@multiconsult.no","linkText":"lars.nermoen@multiconsult.no"}}]},{"type":"p","children":["This information is subject to the disclosure requirements pursuant to section 5-12 of the Norwegian Securities Trading Act